# Never commit machine-local or secret OpenCode files.
#
# `service.json` is generated by OpenCode in ~/.config/opencode/ and contains a
# local service password. It is intentionally not part of this module.
service.json

# Any local overrides that may contain secrets.
*.local.jsonc
*.local.json

# oh-my-opencode-slim runtime state.
#
# `skills-manifest.json` is regenerated by the plugin on every skill-sync (it
# rewrites `updatedAt` and re-hashes the bundled skills), so it would otherwise
# show up as a changed file constantly. When absent, the plugin re-adopts the
# tracked skills under ~/.config/opencode/skills/ as "managed" and writes a new
# manifest on startup, so it is safe to ignore.
.oh-my-opencode-slim/
